  "bodyHash": "d6ee90c14aa7d4ce",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TvbEFU7.png\" width=\"1921\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mbSQxHhbBt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ENSE1Om.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYoCsJCHn1jOnGvKLBs0bqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LTDGG4f.png\" width=\"200\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ProjectCount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSv7RBC.png\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📖简介</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mowzie's Mobs 与 Farmer's Delight 现已兼容，提供原版风格的体验。您现在可以使用 Farmer's Delight 的功能来烹饪 Mowzie's Mobs 中的食材。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📃功能特性</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增带有特殊效果的菜肴与配方</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">太阳刀：用于处理附魔后的太阳系食材</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">爪形装饰：提升烹饪体验</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Burning Bluff —— 提升食物营养值（+50%）和饱和度（+25%）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基于标签（Tags）的其他模组集成支持</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📚开发计划</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在下一次更新中：更完善的集成效果、约 5-15 种新食物以及标签支持。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📝详细说明</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增菜肴与配方</strong>：制作如“娜迦鱼尾”、“冰三明治”、“可食用铁块”等 Mowzie 主题美食。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>独特食材多样性</strong>：尝试使用太阳刀、发光果冻等食材，可按新鲜状态或切片状态用于不同配方。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R91drnt.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>专属厨具与装饰</strong>：使用限定版太阳刀来提升烹饪合成体验。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UIqAmcI.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>存储与展示选项</strong>：将食材分类收纳于多彩的爪形橱柜与发光果冻箱中，并为每种食材类型搭配独特的蛋糕进行展示。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XC25NwX.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oGXeHpS.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Burning Bluff 效果：</strong>副手持打火石时，右键点击棒子可获得燃烧棒。使用该棒子可激活“Burning Bluff”效果，提升食物营养值（+50%）和饱和度（+25%）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zTAQD6o.png\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模组集成</strong>：支持标签系统以确保兼容性，可无缝集成 Origins、Farmer's Delight、Mowzie's Mobs 等模组。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9aQUuvc.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">未来的更新内容将包含一系列新配方与烹饪工具，让玩家能够探索全新风味并制作精致料理。新增的装饰物将优化视觉美感，使厨房与用餐区域更具沉浸感与吸引力。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎨 我们的其他模组</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vegetables-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sTYFDIt.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-changes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0EvRMeF.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglin-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/msiJ1Qo.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-randomite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5W1ePQ5.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/genetics-vegetables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrznpWc.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/schizophrenia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N3mWm8R.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VI5tY37.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/