><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structure-mania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O30xOCO.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-crushing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Kb03qkc.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k8YBCDq.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EL0KUOI.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gx0v2Bi.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您对该模组及其开发感兴趣，或有任何建议，欢迎加入 Discord 服务器（<a href=\"https://discord.gg/mbSQxHhbBt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/mbSQxHhbBt</a>）。</p>",
